    "detailed_description": "Stranded Engineers is a city-building game in which your strategy and economy skills are required. Build large citys on several islands, take care of your buildings and make your citizens happy.<br><br>Plan new housing and work buildings for your citizens, taking care of the tactics and their locations. Fulfill the wishes of residents and increase the number of your population.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434540/extras/937642c43abcf91316acf1d271335360.avif?t=1709054729\" /></span><br><br>Collect various materials to research and unlock new buildings. Keep track of more than 100 different materials and products.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434540/extras/c5e8a6a988786c4f612bf70c3a27101b.avif?t=1709054729\" /></span><br><br>Benefit from research and the expansion of your buildings. Increase production and have multiple workers in the same workshop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434540/extras/845f3270bad2c09a8462d71c692b328b.avif?t=1709054729\" /></span><br><br>Complete tasks and watch out for wild animals and the dangers of the environment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434540/extras/a9e5eafe61d86f9421d6c7fcdfb8a510.avif?t=1709054729\" /></span><br><br>Set up supply routes across the entire island group and create several cities on several islands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434540/extras/86bc405be46185a48e8bde771a9ef761.avif?t=1709054729\" /></span>",
